{
  "body_human_readable": "The current weather in Kyiv is sunny with a temperature of approximately 27\u00b0C (81\u00b0F). The real feel temperature is similar, at around 27\u00b0C (81\u00b0F). There is currently a very low chance of rain, and the humidity is about 42%.\n\nWinds are light, coming from the north at around 12 km/h. The forecast for the rest of the day indicates it will be partly sunny with temperatures ranging between 17\u00b0C and 27\u00b0C.",
